, the box standing upright to the right, speaking to camera. VO (ID, verbatim): "Rapat sekarang lebih fokus." Delivery (EN): calm, relieved 2–4s Beat 2 · same framing, small nod, one hand resting on the table near the box. VO (ID, verbatim): "Tiap klaster tahu tugasnya." Delivery (EN): warm, steady 4–6s Beat 3 · same framing, a brief glance at the laptop screen, then back to camera. VO (ID, verbatim): "Tinggal disesuaikan dengan puskesmas." Delivery (EN): clear, practical 6–8s Beat 4 · same framing, gentle open-palm gesture toward the box. VO (ID, verbatim): "Kalau perlu, detailnya ada di bawah." Delivery (EN): soft, friendly, unhurried 8–10s Beat 5 · same framing, warm smile, friendly eye contact, then holds still for the last second. VO (ID, verbatim): "Semoga membantu tim mutu." Delivery (EN): warm, sincere AUDIO: Calm room ambience with their voice as the only voice, slow and clear. Natural Indonesian, conversational, clear pronunciation, no background music. Lighting/mood: realistic natural light matching the set, clean soft contrast, believable Indonesian setting, not glossy, not studio. Camera: one steady static framing for the whole clip, eye level, no zoom, no pans. Performance: natural facial expression, relaxed posture, natural eye contact, restrained gestures. Lips clearly synced to each word. Hands: simple, natural, relaxed movements. CLEAN OUTPUT: No subtitles, captions or on-screen text overlays. No logos or graphics added. Keep the talent's face, the WARDROBE above, and the box shape, colors and cover consistent with the DNA references.